# The Jones artifact's own WISE mode (process_circuit_wise_arch at d235a22), replayed: its router
# records each reconfiguration as one global permutation with a formula duration and no routes.
# R29 times every other operation (a reconfiguration has no clock, so R29 does not judge it);
# R37 holds the whole machine for one.

ruleset "jones-wise-artifact"
title "Surface-code QCCD, the artifact's WISE mode"
about "Jones's rules, plus the global reconfigurations the artifact records: each one holds every trap, rail and junction, takes positive time and overlaps nothing. Their durations are recorded, not checked; their internal routes are not recorded."

include "jones"
param allow_reconfigure = true
use R37
